<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>steady to $0.50 higher than Monday's close. Top $56.50 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3  230-260 lbs    55.00-56.00, few 56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  260-270 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>	  270-280 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs    42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	 over 500 lbs    48.00-51.00</p>
</text>
